  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 402.06 Quality of Products and Workmanship",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 402.06 Quality of Products and Workmanship. The quality, materials, and workmanship standards of the American Water Works Association (AWWA), specified in Table 402-1 below and available as noted in Appendix B, shall apply to all public water systems relative to construction, operation, and maintenance activities regulated by Env-Dw 300 and Env-Dw 401 through Env-Dw 406.\n\nTable 402-1\n\nStandards of the AWWA\n\nSTANDARD CATEGORY Subcategory (if any) Number | Edition | Title of Standard\n\nSOURCE\n\nGroundwater and Wells\n\nA100-20 | 2020 | Water Wells\n\nTREATMENT\n\nFiltration\n\nB100-16 | 2016 | Granular Filter Material\n\nB101-22 | 2022 | Precoat Filter Media\n\nB102-15(R20) | 2015 | Manganese Greensand for Filters\n\nB112-19 | 2019 | Microfiltration and Ultrafiltration Membrane Systems\n\nB114-22 | 2022 | Reverse Osmosis and Nanofiltration Systems for Water Treatment\n\nB116-19 | 2019 | Electrodialysis and Ion-Exchange Membrane Systems\n\nB130-23 | 2023 | Membrane Bioreactor Systems\n\nSoftening\n\nB200-22 | 2022 | Sodium Chloride\n\nB201-18 | 2018 | Soda Ash\n\nB202-19 | 2019 | Quicklime and Hydrated Lime\n\nDisinfection Chemicals\n\nB300-24 | 2024 | Hypochlorites\n\nB301-24 | 2024 | Liquid Chlorine\n\nB302-23 | 2023 | Ammonium Sulfate\n\nB303-18 | 2018 | Sodium Chlorite\n\nB304-21 | 2021 | Liquid Oxygen for Ozone Generation for Water, Wastewater, and Reclaimed Water Systems\n\nB305-22 | 2022 | Anhydrous Ammonia\n\nB306-22 | 2022 | Aqua Ammonia (Liquid Ammonium Hydroxide)\n\nCoagulation\n\nB402-18 | 2018 | Ferrous Sulfate\n\nB403-24 | 2024 | Aluminum Sulfate-Liquid, Ground, or Lump\n\nB404-22 | 2022 | Liquid Sodium Silicate\n\nB405-24 | 2024 | Sodium Aluminate\n\nB406-20 | 2020 | Ferric Sulfate\n\nB407-18 | 2018 | Liquid Ferric Chloride\n\nB408-18 | 2018 | Liquid Polyaluminum Chloride\n\nB451-23 | 2023 | Poly (Diallyldimethylammonium Chloride)\n\nB452-20 | 2020 | EPI-DMA Polyamines\n\nB453-19 | 2019 | Polyacrylamide\n\nScale and Corrosio