rvice, 2 In. Through 48 In. (50 mm Through 1,200 mm) NPS\n\nC519-18 | 2018 | High-Performance Waterworks Butterfly Valves – 3 In. (75 mm) Through 60 In. (1,500 mm)\n\nC520-24 | 2024 | Knife Gate Valves, Sizes 2 In. (50 mm) Through 96 In. (2,400 mm)\n\nC521-23 | 2023 | Plastic Ball Valves\n\nC522-22 | 2022 | Rotary Cone Valves, 6 In. Through 60 In. (150 mm Through 1,500 mm)\n\nC530-22 | 2022 | Pilot-Operated Control Valves\n\nC541-16(R21) | 2016 | Hydraulic and Pneumatic Cylinder and Vane-Type Actuators for Valves and Slide Gates\n\nC542-16(R21) | 2016 | Electric Motor Actuators for Valves and Slide Gates\n\nC550-17 | 2017 | Protective Interior Coatings for Valves and Hydrants\n\nC560-21 | 2021 | Cast-Iron Slide Gates\n\nC561-21 | 2021 | Fabricated Stainless-Steel Slide Gates\n\nC562-21 | 2021 | Fabricated Aluminum Slide Gates\n\nC563-21 | 2021 | Fabricated Composite Slide Gates\n\nPIPE INSTALLATION\n\nC600-23 | 2023 | Installation of Ductile-Iron Water Mains and Their Appurtenances\n\nC602-23 | 2023 | Cement-Mortar Lining of Water Pipelines in Place -- 4 in. (100 mm) and Larger\n\nC604-17 | 2017 | Installation of Buried Steel Water Pipe – 4 In. (100 mm) and Larger\n\nC605-21 | 2021 | Underground Installation of Polyvinyl Chloride (PVC) and Molecularly Oriented Polyvinyl Chloride (PVCO) Pressure Pipe and Fittings\n\nC606-22 | 2022 | Grooved and Shouldered Joints\n\nC620-19 | 2019 | Spray-In-Place Polymeric Lining for Potable Water Pipelines 4 In. (100 mm) and Larger\n\nC621-18 | 2018 | Internal Pipe Joint Seal Assemblies for Water Service\n\nC622-19 | 2019 | Pipe Bursting of Potable Water Mains 4 In. (100 mm) to 36 In. (900 mm)\n\nC623-22 | 2022 | Cured-In-Place Pipe (CIPP) Rehabilitation of Pressurized Potable Water Pipelines, 4 In. (100 mm) and Larger\n\nDISINFECTION OF FACILITIES\n\nC651-23 | 2023 | Disinfecting Water Mains\n\nC652-19 | 2019 | Disinfection of Water-Storage Facilities\n\nC653-20 | 2020 | Disinfection of Water Treatment Plants\n\nC654-21 | 2021 | Di